  "releaseNotes": "The release candidate for 1.0. From here the package follows semantic versioning over its published interface: a minor or patch version keeps every class, resource key and include path an app names, and only a major version breaks one. Since 0.33.0 a variant switch is fast again; the styles, keys and classes are 0.33.0's.\n\nWhat changed, and how to upgrade: https://github.com/FiliArrochada/Fili.Theme.MudAvalonia/blob/43cc45bc4d23f352a57cc6609e181dcf08b35731/docs/versions/1.0.0-rc.1.md",
